                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "56b64f48-e0ee-3dfd-a7e7-21473339cfcc",
                        "entry_id": "8d2d72b0-3b09-3ee5-bc5d-02156e497961",
                        "glosses": [
                            "rzecz. odczas. od udoskonalić"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "98362f43-1aa3-4450-8ab4-ce84c30cddc8",
                                "sense_id": "56b64f48-e0ee-3dfd-a7e7-21473339cfcc",
                                "text": "Sytuacjoniści nie uznawali własności intelektualnej, głosili, że idee, myśli i dzieła należą do tych, którzy potrafią je udoskonalić. I przywłaszczali sobie wszystko, co ich zdaniem na udoskonalenie zasługiwało: przechwytywali"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6eba3ab0-02dd-4494-8d14-761d5bf7c63c",
                        "source_entry_id": "8d2d72b0-3b09-3ee5-bc5d-02156e497961",
                        "source_sense_id": "56b64f48-e0ee-3dfd-a7e7-21473339cfcc",
                        "target_lang_word": "improvement",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "improvement",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d9372947-4848-385f-912e-50bb34063a64",
                                        "entry_id": "bbaf0596-8aed-38d2-82f6-374eaa61731d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of improving; advancement or growth; a bettering"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64b11b34-6206-4351-97d5-3a7ad7c96b51",
                                                "sense_id": "d9372947-4848-385f-912e-50bb34063a64",
                                                "text": "November 9, 1662, Robert South, Of the Creation of Man in the Image of God\nI look upon your city as […] the best place of improvement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce458918-f555-474e-9897-00e24ccfcf7d",
                                                "sense_id": "d9372947-4848-385f-912e-50bb34063a64",
                                                "text": "Exercise is the chief source of improvement in all our faculties."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "076702e6-5b1d-4b9e-9b24-33a085c5d8f3",
                                                "sense_id": "d9372947-4848-385f-912e-50bb34063a64",
                                                "text": "Nothing was too small to receive attention, if a supervising eye could suggest improvements likely to conduce to the common welfare. Mr. Gordon Burnage, for instance, personally visited dust-bins and back premises, accompanied by a sort of village bailiff, going his round like a commanding officer doing billets."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8b08cd1-9f1e-4511-95a1-2e297d919eaa",
                                                "sense_id": "d9372947-4848-385f-912e-50bb34063a64",
                                                "text": "Private-equity nabobs bristle at being dubbed mere financiers.[…]Much of their pleading is public-relations bluster. Clever financial ploys are what have made billionaires of the industry’s veterans. “Operational improvement” in a portfolio company has often meant little more than promising colossal bonuses to sitting chief executives if they meet ambitious growth targets. That model is still prevalent today."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e57be96c-ae40-3c2f-835a-09569ecb2a49",
                                        "entry_id": "bbaf0596-8aed-38d2-82f6-374eaa61731d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of making profitable use or application of anything, or the state of being profitably employed; practical application, for example of a doctrine, principle, or theory, stated in a discourse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdfaa74a-b58a-4ece-9738-6c3b7fa593ab",
                                                "sense_id": "e57be96c-ae40-3c2f-835a-09569ecb2a49",
                                                "text": "good improvement of his reason."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea17c343-168e-409e-8bc1-4ecb4d20a24b",
                                                "sense_id": "e57be96c-ae40-3c2f-835a-09569ecb2a49",
                                                "text": "I shall make some improvement of this doctrine."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "417d9c93-9db5-3edf-8160-1cba4b7f49fc",
                                        "entry_id": "bbaf0596-8aed-38d2-82f6-374eaa61731d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being improved; betterment; advance"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a383fad-bea0-3b57-ace2-e78a2eb5ee1a",
                                        "entry_id": "bbaf0596-8aed-38d2-82f6-374eaa61731d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something which is improved"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ee3f437-5a2c-4900-a158-13f802223aaa",
                                                "sense_id": "1a383fad-bea0-3b57-ace2-e78a2eb5ee1a",
                                                "text": "the new edition is an improvement on the old."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4562e987-89f9-4a34-86cd-cf860fb61072",
                                                "sense_id": "1a383fad-bea0-3b57-ace2-e78a2eb5ee1a",
                                                "text": "The parts of Sinon, Camilla, and some few others, are improvements on the Greek poet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c77960ef-dca1-33e2-bf98-9dbfd2272411",
                                        "entry_id": "bbaf0596-8aed-38d2-82f6-374eaa61731d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Increase; growth; progress; advance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec795b4e-387b-429d-be17-5af4fc9f1e97",
                                                "sense_id": "c77960ef-dca1-33e2-bf98-9dbfd2272411",
                                                "text": "Those vices which more particularly receive improvement by prosperity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5dd65ef2-1ad8-3e36-bbe8-d9186cf2ef90",
                                        "entry_id": "bbaf0596-8aed-38d2-82f6-374eaa61731d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Valuable additions or betterments, for example buildings, clearings, drains, fences, etc., on premises."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "in-plural",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d7c4aaee-958d-3a0b-a0ed-1940ce7659b9",
                                        "entry_id": "bbaf0596-8aed-38d2-82f6-374eaa61731d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A useful addition to, or modification of, a machine, manufacture, or composition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bd6950e0-8788-41d8-a7f6-54c993d5b22d",
                        "source_entry_id": "8d2d72b0-3b09-3ee5-bc5d-02156e497961",
                        "source_sense_id": "56b64f48-e0ee-3dfd-a7e7-21473339cfcc",
                        "target_lang_word": "perfectionnement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "perfectionnement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1b6b2c84-2e2f-3a93-8618-2150c61d2656",
                                        "entry_id": "51538a93-ab32-3d21-a46f-6d33a854df03",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action de perfectionner ou résultat de cette action."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7425432-68c4-4d43-b736-5ae90528abb8",
                                                "sense_id": "1b6b2c84-2e2f-3a93-8618-2150c61d2656",
                                                "text": "Il faudrait, en premier lieu, répandre parmi nous, par le perfectionnement des institutions de crédit, l'usage des billets, des promesses, des reconnaissances. C'est dire que nos banques devraient cesser de vivre sous l'empire d'un monopole aussi absolu qu'injuste et funeste."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf097c9f-224d-43b6-937f-8eed0c221da9",
                                                "sense_id": "1b6b2c84-2e2f-3a93-8618-2150c61d2656",
                                                "text": "La préoccupation qui, chez les hommes, semble dominer toutes les autres, c’est celle de la vitesse obtenue soit par leurs propres moyens, soit par des instruments, et des appareils de locomotion, au perfectionnement desquels ils appliquent le meilleur de leur ingéniosité et de leurs facultés inventives."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2535fc7-41df-41dd-b287-4be9add7fd8c",
                                                "sense_id": "1b6b2c84-2e2f-3a93-8618-2150c61d2656",
                                                "text": "Ce sont eux qui, dans l'élevage gâtineau, tiennent la vedette et la tiendront jusqu'au jour où les perfectionnements apportés aux méthodes culturales les feront reculer au point d'en amener la quasi-disparition."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec278ff0-cbd6-4f75-8dc7-489c393ad4de",
                                                "sense_id": "1b6b2c84-2e2f-3a93-8618-2150c61d2656",
                                                "text": "Par la suite, le Danois Tycho Brahe et son assistant allemand Johannes Kepler ont ajouté au modèle copernicien d'autres perfectionnements touchant à l'observation ou à sa nature théorique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fbb6385-bb26-45ff-b27f-ddb7d4208b4b",
                                                "sense_id": "1b6b2c84-2e2f-3a93-8618-2150c61d2656",
                                                "text": "Et Olympe s'est retrouvée, avec les gogols, en classe de perfectionnement, puisqu'il s'agit du terme exact. Perfectionnement de quoi ? Nul ne sait. De la relégation, sans doute. Et du mépris dissimulé."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
